Comment: 0,0:24:53.97,0:24:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,----------------text--------------
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.96,0:09:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&H0000B4FF\fn思源黑体 CN Heavy\fs128\pos(355,365)}傾注初芽的愛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&H0000B4FF\fn思源黑体 CN Heavy\fs128\pos(927,365)}傾注初芽的愛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,才這種程度就氣喘吁吁…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你還修行不夠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,小楓不也是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,這是我的演技
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這也是訓練的一環
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 來吃便當吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,五惠做的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.81,0:00:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,很好吃的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.72,0:00:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,還好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.31,0:00:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,這種類型的做給師父會高興嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,其實 也想把白虎帶來的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.15,0:00:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直在基地很無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.99,0:00:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟出門也是比較危險
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.49,0:00:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,白虎已經完全黏上初芽了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是師父的魅力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:01:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的師父也是把白虎收拾的心服口服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 那裡的吉他小哥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我是女的來著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我渴了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.51,0:01:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,給我買碳酸飲料
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.26,0:01:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,啊痛痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.64,0:01:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那之後
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子就不敢在師父面前囂張了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是命
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.98,0:01:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不過初芽之前還被踢了一腳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,現在都變得那麼親近了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.98,0:01:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是她的執念
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.53,0:01:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,執念?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.99,0:01:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,無論是什麼人都要友好相處
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.95,0:01:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,初芽的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺真的可以和特蕾莎做朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.95,0:01:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,連白虎都被攻略了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 一定可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,現在師父
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.46,0:01:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,為了特蕾莎可是拚盡全力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,特蕾莎其實是想著和初芽和好的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就是散布實驗了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要好好監視青葉初芽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,小特蕾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.49,0:03:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,青葉同學
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你昨天好像沒來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我感冒了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,然後 前天真是對不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,對青葉同學說了很過分的話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,啊沒事的 我也太衝動了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.88,0:03:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,以後再兩個人一起去玩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.43,0:04:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,當然
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.85,0:04:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼事不宜遲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,今天放學後去吃好吃的烤鬆餅吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,鬆餅… 嗯一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,為…為什麼要靠過來?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.31,0:04:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不喜歡嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜歡跟朋友互相接觸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然 沒什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,初芽跟特蕾莎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,會變得怎麼樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,初芽真心想要跟她做朋友的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,無論什麼人都會變成她的朋友的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,師父也是?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.26,0:04:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,對於除了武道什麼都視而不見的我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.76,0:04:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直來找我搭話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至讓人厭煩的程度
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,然後不知不覺就
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.81,0:04:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,初芽對我來說
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是第一個朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 最重要的存在是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,小桃 是你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你要注意甜言蜜語
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如果這是戰鬥中的話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,利用語言
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至可以製造對方的空隙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.96,0:05:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.25,0:05:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,已經是夏天了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 師父
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,暑假期間一起去遊樂園或者看煙火嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,鍛鍊跟任務要優先喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.68,0:05:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,暑假期間的安排
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,之後會告訴你的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我推薦蛋奶鬆餅上面加樹莓跟冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好像很好吃的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.82,0:05:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有會穿泳裝的機會嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能會在任務中要用到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,色誘之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,35點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,微妙?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,小桃沒有自知之明
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼成熟樣式的泳衣不適合你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.22,0:06:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.31,0:06:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,五惠 你好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.90,0:06:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,請客觀看待自己
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.57,0:06:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,像我這樣的黃金身材
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}不試穿嗎 挺適合你的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,到打工的時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.54,0:06:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,打工重要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要努力賺錢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那 明天再見
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,暑假一定要和師父她們一起去海邊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,和師父
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 能去就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那樣我也能好好跟…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.05,0:07:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,開始檢驗一下藥效吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.18,0:07:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我們是兩情相悅的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.64,0:07:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,大家 快看我們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一 二 三
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,強盜嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快叫警察 救護車
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.57,0:07:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有人上傳影片了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,開始了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:07:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是發生了什麼事情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是因為這場騷亂
Comment: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7}車站前發生了很不得了的事件
Comment: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7}從空崎市的朋友那裡聽說 發生了大事
Comment: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7}外面發生了暴動
Comment: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7}商店街 不得了
Comment: 0,0:08:02.59,0:08:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:08:02.59,0:08:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7}現在車站前是怎麼了 到底是發生了什麼事情
Comment: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7}大家 外面很危險 都待在家裡吧
Comment: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7}外面好吵啊
Comment: 0,0:08:02.71,0:08:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7}好多人在外面親熱 發生了什麼事
Comment: 0,0:08:02.75,0:08:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7}公園裡有人被綁在樹上了 什麼情況
Comment: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7}空崎 像終末一樣
Comment: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7}賽車前發生了暴動
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你要怎麼辦 青葉初芽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是月影的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,為了保護城市
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.97,0:08:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,一定會有所行動
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,到底發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,五惠親呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,小初現在不參與任務
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道為什麼我聯繫不到五惠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.23,0:08:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,難道被捲入到暴動裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.45,0:08:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我來尋找五惠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,大家先對付城市裡的暴徒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.07,0:08:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.41,0:08:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有五惠跟初芽來解決這場暴動嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,只能上了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不行動嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那我先離開一下再觀察嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.31,0:08:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.48,0:08:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,她在暴徒中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.77,0:09:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕已經陷入催眠狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,發生了什麼事情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.17,0:09:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我是月影中的一員
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.14,0:09:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我要揍你們一頓
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}消除 消除
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,甦醒子彈沒有用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,只能用催眠彈讓他們睡著了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,世界末日了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,大 大事件
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,別想碰我店裡的肉一根手指頭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.17,0:10:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你們 快適可而止
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,確認左右衛門所在地
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,半藏收到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,百地收到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我是月影
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.98,0:10:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,然後特蕾你 是魍魎對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.15,0:10:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你 為什麼攤牌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我想跟小特蕾你成為真正的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,再繼續互相試探也沒有任何意義
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下我必須去救助我的朋友們
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,她們是重要的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.42,0:10:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,然後呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我們做個交易吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不跟其他人說特蕾你是魍魎的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.01,0:10:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我也默許特蕾你對我的監視
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,這談不上交易
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.35,0:11:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你不一定會遵守交易
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,而且就是我身份暴露也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.15,0:11:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是因為特蕾你的存在就是為了引出月影嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.32,0:11:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不會接受這種不知真假的交易
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,沒辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我在月影裡還擔任道具開發的任務
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,無論是開鎖髮夾 還是蒙眼噴霧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.30,0:11:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 毒也有用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.01,0:11:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.68,0:11:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,這是神經毒素 十分鐘後你就不能動彈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,解毒藥在學校裡 我的櫃子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.35,0:11:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,這是鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,初芽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.98,0:11:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,終於肯叫我名字了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.73,0:11:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你動不了 就讓我來照顧你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,永遠 永遠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:11:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我們是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,五惠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.01,0:12:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶 是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,現在給我的帳戶上面轉點錢 我遇到大麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,老大 匯款已經到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,老實人真好騙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,老大 打起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.82,0:12:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 哪個團伙的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.78,0:12:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是女高中生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,拿好刀槍再上 不要小看敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:13:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:13:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,看來已經失去理智了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.69,0:14:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,妨礙者 清除
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.95,0:14:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,欸 那動作怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,別開槍 她是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,百地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,被師父抱著 恢復速度會變快呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.72,0:14:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,看樣子沒事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,五右衛門的等級是橫綱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs35}橫綱：相撲最高等級
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.31,0:14:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是月影的隱秘王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.56,0:14:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,欸 比大關的師父等級還要高?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.74,0:14:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,半藏 五右衛門在你那裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在我這 但是失去了心智
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她毀了一個團伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.83,0:14:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我們只能盡力了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:15:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不 盡全力都不知道能不能阻止她
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我來阻止她
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.97,0:15:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,由我來說服她
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.09,0:15:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那我把你的聲音讓她聽到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,師父
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.97,0:15:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,局來說服五右衛門
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我們的任務是不讓她從這棟樓走出去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,控制住受害範圍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,五惠 聽到我說話了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,冷靜下來聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我雖然不知道為什麼五惠會淪落到這種地步
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我知道真正的五惠是不會做這種事的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.85,0:15:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,五惠是很溫柔的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.48,0:16:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,會幫助陷入困境的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.23,0:16:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不會對受傷的人坐視不管
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,別人傷心的話自己也會感同身受
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.16,0:16:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,五惠 你記得和我相遇時候的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.66,0:16:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你想救被當成害獸殺掉的亂波
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.66,0:16:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs35}亂波：忍者浣熊的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.21,0:16:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然你只有一個人 力量單薄
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.75,0:16:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,但你還是拚盡全力想要救它
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜歡上了那樣的你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那時我就想 我要成為你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.60,0:16:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,想著一定會成為最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.89,0:16:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,結果也如我所願
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你成為了我的徒弟 也成了我最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,對於我來說 五惠你是無可替代的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.11,0:16:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你對我來說 比任何人任何事都要重要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,溫柔的五惠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.87,0:16:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我最重要的五惠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想看到你被傷害和傷害他人的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.30,0:17:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,初芽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.69,0:17:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我會接受五惠的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.11,0:17:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,強大 溫柔 害羞 為家人著想 為朋友著想
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.37,0:17:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,很會做菜 喜歡可愛的東西 愛哭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那樣的你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.84,0:17:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那樣的你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.35,0:18:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜歡了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.49,0:18:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,師父
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,五惠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.95,0:18:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.87,0:18:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼做了這種事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,五惠清醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我都做了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.05,0:18:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係的 五惠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.93,0:18:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一點也不好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.81,0:18:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我特長只有身體能力卻…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.44,0:18:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我不配做月影
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.19,0:18:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,攻擊人們傷害伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.24,0:18:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不用說了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.70,0:18:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.16,0:18:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,五惠是我重要的弟子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.41,0:19:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是本人也不想聽到她的壞話
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.83,0:19:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,師父
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.34,0:19:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,這是群體心理引發的群體性癔病症吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fn微软雅黑\b1\pos(970.667,493.444)}奇蹟的0死者
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(624,562.778)\bord0\fn微软雅黑\b1\i1\c&H005A6C7A}空崎市的{\c&H006282E7}謎之暴動 {\c&H00CF8B5C}光天化日之下發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然警察也按部就班的採取行動…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,根據這情報搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.06,0:19:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是魍魎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我嘗試調查是否和魍魎有關
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但是沒查出
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是一種可以剝奪意識的藥物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.82,0:19:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,人們吸入後被下達了瘋狂的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.20,0:19:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,目的現在還不好推測
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,然後這是分析城市的監控錄影
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,和在網路上上傳的影片
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.79,0:19:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,這個操控無人機散布噴霧的男子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在很多地點都發現他的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是變裝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,骨骼和臉的線條不相稱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:19:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,能看出來嗎 楓
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.09,0:20:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,蒙蔽不了精通變裝的我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼找這個男人也沒用嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.31,0:20:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,還有一個線索
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,從五惠的血液中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,發現了只分布在沖繩的植物的萃取物
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,如果順著這條線索的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,對 可能就是噴霧的製造場所
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來是沖繩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.58,0:20:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,師父 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.17,0:20:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.47,0:20:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.97,0:20:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我是五惠的師父
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.39,0:20:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,請相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那時候師父說了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.73,0:20:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那時候?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.31,0:20:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,說過會接受我的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.23,0:20:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 也請接受我的任性
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.36,0:20:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,任性?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.41,0:21:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,請多看著我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.03,0:21:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想更多的和師父在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一起去玩 手牽著手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我想這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想和五惠在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.39,0:21:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,師父
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.97,0:21:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,五惠真可愛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.94,0:21:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0078736F\bord0\fs40\t(\fs36\move(553,497,563,483))\fn思源黑体 CN Normal\frz351.1}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.94,0:21:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0078736F\bord0\fs40\t(\fs36\move(600,540,605,520))\fn思源黑体 CN Normal\frz351.1}有毒是騙你的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.94,0:21:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0078736F\bord0\fs40\t(\fs36\move(720,593,715,568))\fn思源黑体 CN Normal\frz351.1}但是想和小特蕾成為朋友是真心的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,散布實驗成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.95,0:21:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在人類走向歧路前
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.24,0:21:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我們魍魎統治和指引他們的那天就要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.99,0:21:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 聽聽你的報告吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,青葉初芽確實是月影
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.67,0:21:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,基地和其他成員呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.54,0:21:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,還沒…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.88,0:21:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,以你的效率不應該啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,開始享受學校生活了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.05,0:22:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我們不需要迷茫的人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.60,0:22:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧 奇奇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.87,0:23:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,首先祝賀你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.70,0:23:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,實驗好像成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.08,0:23:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,為了不讓人妨礙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.29,0:23:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,先和合作的各組織聯絡一下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我已下達了防衛委託書
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.05,0:24:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,真是神速
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.88,0:24:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼 晚香玉的實行日呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.59,0:24:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,8月18日
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.26,0:24:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那天 空崎市的人將會多的溢出
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.89,0:24:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,沙翁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.02,0:24:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,切西瓜 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.86,0:24:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,金楚糕
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.73,0:24:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 沖繩
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.28,0:24:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就算只是精神上也要感受假日氣氛
Comment: 0,0:24:53.97,0:24:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,----------------next--------------
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.97,0:24:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,500)\3c&H004B463D\bord4\blur3\fs90\fn思源黑体 CN Heavy}N機關情報
Dialogue: 1,0:24:14.97,0:24:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,500)\c&H003DAD46\3c&H004D4E3E\bord2\blur0\fs90\fn思源黑体 CN Heavy}N機關情報
Comment: 0,0:24:53.97,0:24:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,----------------in--------------
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:01.59,inJP,,0,0,0,,They say - she is a shy one
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.59,0:13:04.05,inJP,,0,0,0,,I’ve always been in the shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.39,0:13:06.39,inJP,,0,0,0,,But now it’s time to let go
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:08.89,inJP,,0,0,0,,And show you my real power
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:11.15,inJP,,0,0,0,,I may seem dainty and weak
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.23,0:13:13.69,inJP,,0,0,0,,But you’d better not to pick on me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:16.07,inJP,,0,0,0,,Some flowers may have the thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.15,0:13:18.53,inJP,,0,0,0,,You’d better not to play with me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.61,0:13:20.99,inJP,,0,0,0,,My mama always, always told me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:23.32,inJP,,0,0,0,,Be nice and sweet, but brave and strong
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.49,0:13:26.58,inJP,,0,0,0,,You got it right, I am to get you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:27.91,inJP,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:29.79,inJP,,0,0,0,,Girls
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:32.04,inJP,,0,0,0,,Let’s show them what we got
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:31.83,inJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9}Uh, Sugar and spice
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:33.17,inJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9}And everything nice
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:34.46,inJP,,0,0,0,,Girls
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:36.80,inJP,,0,0,0,,That is what we made of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.79,0:13:36.88,inJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9}Uh, Sugar and spice
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:38.55,inJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9}And everything nice
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:13:59.49,inJP,,0,0,0,,My parents always, always told me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.53,0:14:01.49,inJP,,0,0,0,,Be cute and kind, but cool and tough
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:05.53,inJP,,0,0,0,,I got it right I’m going my way
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:08.99,inJP,,0,0,0,,And now you know my recipe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:11.25,inJP,,0,0,0,,Be nice and sweet, but brave and strong
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:14.50,inJP,,0,0,0,,You got it right, I’m going forward
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:15.92,inJP,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.09,0:14:17.71,inJP,,0,0,0,,Girls
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:20.01,inJP,,0,0,0,,Let’s show them what we got
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:19.46,inJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9}Uh, Sugar and spice
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.76,inJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9}And everything nice
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:22.30,inJP,,0,0,0,,Girls
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.51,0:14:24.97,inJP,,0,0,0,,You opened my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.97,0:14:25.05,inJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9}Uh, Sugar and spice
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.05,0:14:26.30,inJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9}And everything nice
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:01.59,inCN,,0,0,0,,他們說我很害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.59,0:13:04.05,inCN,,0,0,0,,我總是處於暗處
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.39,0:13:06.39,inCN,,0,0,0,,但現在是時候出擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:08.89,inCN,,0,0,0,,向你展示我真正的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:11.15,inCN,,0,0,0,,我可能看起來較小虛弱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.23,0:13:13.69,inCN,,0,0,0,,但你最好別招惹我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:16.07,inCN,,0,0,0,,像一些花附有荊棘那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.15,0:13:18.53,inCN,,0,0,0,,你最好別跟我過招
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.61,0:13:20.99,inCN,,0,0,0,,媽媽總是教我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:23.32,inCN,,0,0,0,,要親切可人 同時也要勇敢堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.49,0:13:26.58,inCN,,0,0,0,,你說對了 我正是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:27.91,inCN,,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:29.79,inCN,,0,0,0,,女孩們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:32.04,inCN,,0,0,0,,給他們看看我們所得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:31.83,inCN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}有砂糖和香料
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.83,0:13:33.17,inCN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}一切就會美好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:34.46,inCN,,0,0,0,,女孩們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:36.80,inCN,,0,0,0,,那正是我們的本質
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.79,0:13:36.88,inCN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}有砂糖和香料
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:38.55,inCN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}一切就會美好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:13:59.49,inCN,,0,0,0,,父母總是教我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.53,0:14:01.49,inCN,,0,0,0,,要可愛友善 同時也要冷酷堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:05.53,inCN,,0,0,0,,我覺得很對 並認真履行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:08.99,inCN,,0,0,0,,現在你知道我的秘訣了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:11.25,inCN,,0,0,0,,親切可人 同時勇敢堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:14.50,inCN,,0,0,0,,你說得對 我正不斷成長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:15.92,inCN,,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.09,0:14:17.71,inCN,,0,0,0,,女孩們
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:20.01,inCN,,0,0,0,,給他們看看我們所得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:19.46,inCN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}有砂糖和香料
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.76,inCN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}一切就會美好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:22.30,inCN,,0,0,0,,女孩們
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.51,0:14:24.97,inCN,,0,0,0,,你拓展了我的視野
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.97,0:14:25.05,inCN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}有砂糖和香料
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.05,0:14:26.30,inCN,,0,0,0,,{\an9}一切就會美好
