Comment: 0,0:02:21.75,0:02:24.75,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k0}{\k300}潛入敵後
Comment: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:31.17,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k0}{\k630}繼承的羈絆  斬斷一切
Comment: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:32.42,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k0}{\k71}一齊
Comment: 0,0:02:32.51,0:02:35.43,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k0}{\k292}那孩子是誰  只有她自知
Comment: 0,0:02:35.51,0:02:38.22,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k271}大鬧一場吧  盡情鬧吧
Comment: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:40.68,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k222}不只是可愛哦
Comment: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:44.27,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k352}今日颯爽登場
